  "comments": "Runnable planar multibody demo stored as a native mechanical island: three uniform rigid rods are connected in series by frictionless revolute joints and released horizontally under gravity. Keeping the already-lowered island in the example avoids an interpreter-thread dependency when Run is pressed. The real-time XY Scope animates the end-point trajectory while the Scope overlays all three absolute rod angles.",
  "name": "Planar Rigid Triple Pendulum",
